RC or PLC in Nobles County","/arc-plc/minnesota/nobles-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record in Nobles County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025, January to February came in at 21% of normal on the middle of the grids, while June to July hit 144%. Grid 28636 had its driest year in 1976 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
